al-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 169.07, 482.73, 192.07], "text": "Your plan: KP GA Signature Gold HMO (plan ID 89942GA0130002). Sent by: Claims Review\n(synthetic sender).", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 169.07, 482.73, 179.07], "start": 0, "end": 84}, {"bbox": [72.0, 182.07, 154.25, 192.07], "start": 85, "end": 104}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.8", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 201.69, 321.21, 214.69], "text": "Notice of Adverse Benefit Determination", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 201.69, 321.21, 214.69], "start": 0, "end": 39}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.9", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 227.97, 258.17, 237.97], "text": "Claim number: SYN-CLM-20260903-1182", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 227.97, 258.17, 237.97], "start": 0, "end": 35}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.10", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 246.97, 217.08, 256.97], "text": "Date of service: August 27, 2026", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 246.97, 217.08, 256.97], "start": 0, "end": 32}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.11", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 265.97, 229.27, 275.97], "text": "Provider: Northside Surgical Center", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 265.97, 229.27, 275.97], "start": 0, "end": 35}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.12", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 284.97, 183.72, 294.97], "text": "Claim amount: $6,420.00", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 284.97, 183.72, 294.97], "start": 0, "end": 23}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.13", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 303.97, 483.87, 326.97], "text": "We have denied payment for an outpatient knee arthroscopy because prior authorization was\nnot obtained before the procedure.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 303.97, 483.87, 313.97], "start": 0, "end": 89}, {"bbox": [72.0, 316.97, 225.43, 326.97], "start": 90, "end": 124}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.14", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 335.97, 464.38, 345.97], "text": "Denial code CO-197: prior authorization was required for this service and was not on file.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 335.97, 464.38, 345.97], "start": 0, "end": 90}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.15", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 354.97, 457.73, 377.97], "text": "This decision is based on the Prior Authorization requirements in Section 7, Benefits, of\nyour Evidence of Coverage.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 354.97, 457.73, 364.97], "start": 0, "end": 89}, {"bbox": [72.0, 367.97, 195.39, 377.97], "start": 90, "end": 116}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.16", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 386.97, 468.87, 409.97], "text": "You may request the diagnosis code and the treatment code for this claim, and what each\ncode means, at no cost.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 386.97, 468.87, 396.97], "start": 0, "end": 87}, {"bbox": [72.0, 399.97, 178.17, 409.97], "start": 88, "end": 111}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.17", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 419.18, 168.58, 430.18], "text": "Your appeal rights", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 419.18, 168.58, 430.18], "start": 0, "end": 18}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.18", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 443.27, 442.71, 466.27], "text": "You may file an internal appeal within 180 days after you receive this notice. We will\ndecide a post-service appeal within 60 days after we receive it.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 443.27, 442.71, 453.27], "start": 0, "end": 86}, {"bbox": [72.0, 456.27, 349.34, 466.27], "start": 87, "end": 151}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.19", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 475.27, 477.77, 511.27], "text": "To start an appeal, write to Member Appeals, PO Box 0000, Atlanta, GA 30300, and include\nany records that support your request. If we uphold this denial, you may ask for an\nexternal review by an independent reviewer.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 475.27, 477.77, 485.27], "start": 0, "end": 88}, {"bbox": [72.0, 488.27, 435.51, 498.27], "start": 89, "end": 172}, {"bbox": [72.0, 501.27, 267.64, 511.27], "start": 173, "end": 216}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.20", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 520.27, 481.04, 543.27], "text": "For free help, you may contact Consumer Services at the Georgia Office of Commissioner of\nInsurance and Safety Fire.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 520.27, 481.04, 530.27], "start": 0, "end": 89}, {"bbox": [72.0, 533.27, 189.28, 543.27], "start": 90, "end": 116}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga#p1.21", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 234.74, 759.66], "text": "Synthetic · synthetic-denial-kaiser-ga Page 1", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 234.74, 759.66], "start": 0, "end": 45}], "kind": "paragraph"}]}